{
  "name": "cloud-itonami-tsukuru",
  "main": "dist/worker.js",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-08-05",
  "compatibility_flags": ["nodejs_compat"],
  "observability": { "enabled": true }
  // NO D1 binding. ADR-2608039000 forbids D1 as a premise on any path that
  // claims to be decentralised, and this actor's ref/head plane is
  // kotobase.net through kotoba-lang/kotobase-client -- authorization,
  // tenant isolation and replay protection are the service's, not this
  // Worker's.
  //
  // Secrets (set with `wrangler secret put`), never placed here:
  //   KOTOBASE_SECRET_KEY  the marketplace actors' shared Ed25519 seed
  //                        (base64, 32 bytes). :apex requires the graph
  //                        scope to equal the issuer DID and the eight
  //                        actors share one graph, so they share one key.
  //                        Per-actor attribution does not depend on it:
  //                        persist/stream-ctx scopes every ledger by actor
  //                        name inside the shared ref.
  //   ACTOR_WRITE_TOKEN    gates every POST and the two ledger reads.
  //                        Catalog reads are open.
}
